---
import Site from "../layouts/Site.astro";
import { STEPS, stepHref, link } from "../data/nav.js";
---
<Site title="找不到这个页面 · Page not found">
  <article class="xxd-prose">
    <h1>找不到这个页面</h1>
    <p>链接可能写错了，或者页面换了地址。可以按 <kbd class="xxd-kbd">⌘K</kbd> 搜索，或者从这里重新开始：</p>
    <ul>
      <li><a href={link("/")}>首页：一张图看懂</a></li>
      <li><a href={stepHref(STEPS[0])}>主线教程：从第 0 步开始</a></li>
      <li><a href={link("/faq/")}>常见问题</a></li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Page not found</h2>
    <p>The link may be wrong, or the page has moved. Start again from:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><a href={link("/", "en")}>Home: the big picture</a></li>
      <li><a href={stepHref(STEPS[0], "en")}>Main guide: start at step 0</a></li>
      <li><a href={link("/faq/", "en")}>FAQ</a></li>
    </ul>
  </article>
</Site>
